OL,3,GNEWSAIOPC calls for probe into 'Putney
OL,4,Apusher' arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police watchdog has said the
OL,7,FMetropolitan Police's professional
OL,8,Fstandards unit should investigate the
OL,9,Fforce's handling of a case in which a
OL,10,Fman suspected of pushing a woman into
OL,11,Fthe path of a bus on Putney Bridge was
OL,12,Ffound dead.
OL,14,FNicholas Brandram was found dead at his
OL,15,FLondon home on 15 September. His family
OL,16,Fsaid he took his own life after the
OL,17,F"immense pressure" of a police
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
